1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,575
Day 1 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,403
Yesterday, Leo was
all alone…

3
00:00:04,403 --> 00:00:05,507
…and then you
showed up!

4
00:00:05,847 --> 00:00:07,563
Yesterday: 1 resident.

5
00:00:07,563 --> 00:00:08,826
Today? 57!

6
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:12,461
That brings
€56,042 into the budget!

7
00:00:12,801 --> 00:00:15,840
Ecaterina, ExtTalCat and Kalina
move in with Leo!

8
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,054
His house is full!

9
00:00:17,394 --> 00:00:19,493
Joshua asked for
a separate house…

10
00:00:19,493 --> 00:00:20,187
Here it is!

11
00:00:20,527 --> 00:00:22,882
But 47 of you
still sleep in tents!

12
00:00:23,222 --> 00:00:25,141
2 of you wanted
an apartment block…

13
00:00:25,141 --> 00:00:26,822
Room for 120 more!

14
00:00:27,162 --> 00:00:29,725
Yoan, Gabor and 45 more
move in!

15
00:00:29,725 --> 00:00:33,252
Welcome Ambo, kratos, Minijr, James and Ray!

16
00:00:33,592 --> 00:00:34,768
And what do you
want next?

17
00:00:34,768 --> 00:00:36,788
School and police station
are tied!

18
00:00:37,128 --> 00:00:39,715
The school costs
€120,000.

19
00:00:39,715 --> 00:00:41,755
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

20
00:00:42,095 --> 00:00:43,881
Who wants to be
the first principal?

21
00:00:43,881 --> 00:00:45,098
Tell me in the
comments!
